// Title: WinRAR Creating Files in Startup Locations
// Rule ID: 74a2b37d-fea4-41e0-9ac7-c9fbcf1f60cc
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1547.001
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_winrar_file_creation_in_startup_folder.yml
//
